# AWS Cloud Labs

**Hands-on AWS Cloud Engineering Portfolio**

Welcome to my AWS Cloud Labs repository. This portfolio documents practical cloud engineering projects focused on infrastructure, networking, identity and access management, security, monitoring, and automation.

## Objectives

- Design and deploy AWS cloud infrastructure.
- Apply AWS security and least-privilege principles.
- Practice Infrastructure as Code (IaC) with Terraform.
- Implement monitoring and operational best practices.
- Document technical decisions, troubleshooting, and lessons learned.

