## Lab Documentation Standards

Each completed lab aims to include:

1. Problem statement and learning objectives
2. Architecture diagram and design decisions
3. Prerequisites and required permissions
4. Step-by-step implementation instructions
5. Validation results and screenshots
6. Security considerations and troubleshooting
7. Cleanup instructions and estimated cost considerations

## Security

No AWS credentials, access keys, private keys, tokens, or sensitive configuration files should be committed to this repository. All examples must use safe placeholders and follow least-privilege principles.

